Third-party data are not covered by either licence
--------------------------------------------------

Data fetched from public APIs and values read from published documents remain the property
of their publishers and carry their own terms, recorded per source in
`docs/SOURCE_REGISTER.md` and per dataset in the lineage record `data/lineage/<dataset>.json`.
The raw cache (`data/raw/`) and the published documents it contains are not distributed with
this repository; `make history` refetches them from the original publishers. Nord Pool
aggregated bidding curves are never included, in any form; only parameters derived from them
are, with the date they were read (SPECIFICATION.md R-DATA-10).
